    {
      "id": "2027-Quan-3-3",
      "entry": {
        "title": "2027 Quantitative Methods Mod3-Q3",
        "itemBody": "<p>Given the prices of the following three stocks, what is the percentage change in the price-weighted index for the period? Stock t = 0 t = 1 A 30 35 B 20 15 C 10 13</p>",
