      "id": "2027-Quan-3-7",
      "entry": {
        "title": "2027 Quantitative Methods Mod3-Q7",
        "itemBody": "<p>Three companies are included in various indexes. A significant increase in the value of Company A is announced. Which type of index will benefit the most from Company A’s increase in value?</p>",
