      "id": "2027-Quan-3-11",
      "entry": {
        "title": "2027 Quantitative Methods Mod3-Q11",
        "itemBody": "<p>Consider the investment in the following table: Start of Year 1 One share purchased at $100 End of Year 1 $5.00 dividend/share paid and one additional share purchased at $125 End of Year 2 $5.00 dividend/share paid and both shares are sold for $140 per share Assuming dividends are not reinvested, compared with the time-weighted return, the money-weighted return is:</p>",
