        "itemBody": "<p>An investor summarizes end-of-year cash outlays and proceeds from a two-year investment in a company's shares below: Year Outlays Proceeds 0 $100 to purchase the first share --- 1 $110 to purchase the second share $10 dividend received from first share (not reinvested) 2 --- $230 received from selling two shares at $115 per share The annualized time-weighted rate of return of the investment over the two-year period is closest to:</p>",
